  "body": "These are not like the other townhouses you've been looking at. \r\n\r\nBefore you make any comparisons, you absolutely must come and experience these homes in person. The quality, design, proportions and overall feel are in a class of their own, and it's only when you walk through them that you'll truly understand the difference.\r\n\r\nPriced exceptionally well for a brand-new, quality three-bedroom, two-bathroom freehold townhouse, they represent outstanding value in one of Auckland's most sought-after beachside suburbs.\r\n\r\nOne of only two homes remaining in this exclusive development, with thirteen already sold. The owners who have already moved in are loving the vibrant location, welcoming community and relaxed coastal lifestyle, and they're looking forward to welcoming you as their newest neighbour.\r\n\r\nThis is your opportunity to secure a brand-new home just 300 metres from Narrow Neck Beach. These architecturally designed, two-level freehold townhouses combine contemporary living with an exceptional coastal lifestyle.\r\nThe area is further enhanced by excellent school zoning, including Takapuna Grammar School, Belmont Intermediate, Belmont Primary and Vauxhall Primary, making this an ideal choice for families seeking highly regarded education options.\r\n\r\nPerfect for downsizers wanting a secure, low-maintenance lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, as well as first-home buyers and young professionals looking to enjoy the convenience and atmosphere of this sought-after coastal neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nWaitemata Golf Club is at the end of the street, while nearby cafés, schools and Devonport Village complete the lifestyle picture. Whether it's summer days at the beach, a relaxed round of golf, or a quick ferry commute into the city, Handley Avenue places you right at the heart of it all.\r\n\r\nWhat Makes These Homes Unique\r\n* Freehold titles\r\n* Architecturally designed, two-level homes\r\n* Premium beachside location\r\n* Just 300 metres from Narrow Neck Beach\r\n* Off-street parking\r\n* Completed and ready to move into\r\n* Backed by a 10-year Stamford Warranty for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nWith only two homes remaining, now is the time to secure your place in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nCall now for a private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view and download property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/53KM",
